{
  "detailsPage": 0,
  "detailsText": "Classes\nKill special enemies on Normal, Hard or Harder to advance trophy drops. Easy drops no trophies; at most 3 appear per run.\nTap a trophy: a non-Adventurer below class level 10 can randomly gain a level or attempt to unlock a class. New classes are chosen randomly from locked classes. If none remain, the current class gains a level if eligible.\nRaces\nA class at level 5 shares its default race with other classes. A class must also reach level 5 to change its own race. Adventurer stays Human.\nClass levels persist in your profile and come from trophies, separately from XP levels within a run.",
